From 506beda020bbe576294122dccc7b483bf8167019 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:04:57 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): name inputs in machine editor, pane, and page

Every ComboBox, TextEdit, and DragValue across the Machine setup page,
the Machines pane filter bar, and the Machine editor (mill/lathe, wire
EDM, and sinker EDM sections) now sets a distinct descriptive AccessKit
label via fields::named / fields::num*_named.

Refs #1119
---
