 crates/ui/src/egui_app/machine_editor.rs      | 51 ++++++++-------
 crates/ui/src/egui_app/machine_edm.rs         | 24 +++----
 crates/ui/src/egui_app/machine_edm_editor.rs  | 18 ++---
 crates/ui/src/egui_app/machine_page.rs        |  3 +-
 crates/ui/src/egui_app/machines_pane.rs       |  3 +-
